(GLOOMHAVEN: JAWS OF THE LION - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A cooperative campaign of tactical battles. Each player controls a hero with a) Tj T*
(personal deck of ability cards. Scenarios have an objective; failing it means you) Tj T*
(replay the scenario.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A ROUND) Tj T*
(1. Card selection: each player secretly chooses 2 ability cards. One of them is the) Tj T*
(   leading card:) Tj T*
(   its initiative number decides when you act. You may instead declare a long rest.) Tj T*
(2. Monster ability cards are revealed for each monster type.) Tj T*
(3. Everyone acts in initiative order, lowest first.) Tj T*
(4. End of round: element infusions wane and players may take a short rest.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Perform the top action of one card and the bottom action of the other card. Cards with) Tj T*
(a loss symbol go to the lost pile when you use that action; other cards go to the) Tj T*
(discard pile. Instead of an action you may always do a basic attack 2 \(top\) or a basic) Tj T*
(move 2 \(bottom\).) Tj T*
ET
