(RESTING) Tj T*
(- Long rest \(initiative 99, takes the whole turn\): heal 2, refresh spent items and) Tj T*
(   return your) Tj T*
(discard pile to your hand, losing one discarded card of your choice.) Tj T*
(- Short rest \(end of round\): return your discard pile to your hand, losing one random) Tj T*
(   card.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(EXHAUSTION) Tj T*
(A hero is exhausted when their hit points reach 0 or when they cannot play 2 cards or) Tj T*
(rest.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ATTACK MODIFIERS) Tj T*
(Each attack draws one modifier card: +0, +1, -1, +2, -2, x2 \(double\) or null \(miss\).) Tj T*
(If x2 or null was drawn, shuffle the modifier deck at the end of the round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(Poison \(+1 damage taken\), Wound \(1 damage at the start of each turn\), Immobilize \(no) Tj T*
(move\), Disarm \(no attack\), Stun \(no actions\), Muddle \(disadvantage\), Strengthen) Tj T*
(\(advantage\), Invisible \(cannot be targeted\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELEMENTS) Tj T*
(Fire, ice, air, earth, light and dark can be infused. A new infusion is strong; it) Tj T*
(becomes waning at the end of the round and then inert. Consuming an element improves) Tj T*
(some abilities.) Tj T*
